<view class="page monitor-page"><view class="eyebrow fade-in">MONITOR / PRODUCTION LINES</view><view class="title fade-in">产线监控</view><view class="subtitle fade-in">看节拍、看等待、看今天该先处理什么。</view><view class="monitor-toolbar fade-in delay-1"><view><text class="toolbar-label">CURRENT SIGNAL</text><text class="toolbar-value">{{refreshed}} · 60s window</text></view><button class="tiny-button" bindtap="refresh">↻ 刷新</button></view><view class="line-stack fade-in delay-1"><block wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="id"><button class="line-card card {{selected === item.id ? 'line-selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectLine"><view class="line-card-head"><view><view class="line-code">{{item.code}}</view><view class="line-name">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="line-status"><view class="status-dot status-dot-{{item.status}}"></view>{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view class="line-metrics"><view><text class="metric-number">{{item.utilization}}<text>%</text></text><text class="metric-caption">利用率</text></view><view><text class="metric-number">{{item.output}}</text><text class="metric-caption">今日产出</text></view><view><text class="metric-number">{{item.target}}</text><text class="metric-caption">目标</text></view></view><view class="trend-bars"><view class="bar bar-1"></view><view class="bar bar-2"></view><view class="bar bar-3"></view><view class="bar bar-4"></view><view class="bar bar-5"></view><view class="bar bar-6"></view><view class="bar bar-7"></view><view class="bar bar-8"></view><view class="bar bar-9"></view><view class="bar bar-10"></view><view class="bar bar-11"></view><view class="bar bar-12"></view></view><view class="line-note">{{item.note}}<text class="line-arrow">›</text></view></button></block></view><view class="monitor-footer card-dark"><view class="footer-kicker">WHAT THIS MEANS</view><view class="footer-title">移动端只显示证据摘要</view><view class="footer-copy">碰撞、端口、寻路和仿真结果仍以 ForgeMind Web 工作台为准。需要调整布局时，从工厂档案返回桌面工作台。</view><button class="footer-button" bindtap="openFactory">打开工厂档案 ↗</button></view></view>

